      "review_summary": "The branch replaces regex-based web_fetch HTML-to-Markdown fallback conversion with a forward-only scanner and adds malformed-HTML, raw-text, anchor, title, and markdown-fence regression tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +546, Tests +260. Total +806 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: Not fully: source inspection shows current main still uses broad regex replacements over untrusted HTML, but the PR does not include a high-confidence real web_fetch timing reproduction. The best current proof is source-level plus focused tests, not an observed user-path hang.",
